    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chosen Card Chronicles is a charming, card-collecting visual novel adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chris is a troubled young man recovering from a tragic incident that left him speechless. At his little sister Charlotte's strong insistence, he moves in with his cousins Mona and Melanie Mooney to make a fresh start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon his arrival, the girls introduce him to <strong>Tower of the Chosen</strong>, a mysterious card game that quickly becomes his sole means of emotional and intellectual expression...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Card Combat:</strong> Experience fast, unpredictable duels where combos and strategic decision-making are key to victory! Overcome increasingly difficult opponents as you progress through the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Visual Novel Storytelling:</strong> Meet and befriend over 25 captivating characters! Challenge them to battles, use their strategies to improve your own, and form lasting bonds through your shared love of cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Freedom:</strong> Discover and collect over 900 cards! Mix and match elements to create the ultimate deck! Experiment with endless possibilities: there are tons of synergies and combos to discover! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Events &amp; Tournaments:</strong> Test your skills in a variety of special events and tournaments that reward strategic thinking and creativity!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
